                                                "sense_id": "9aee59d6-aa1e-3ead-9cd4-3f97c3bf4054",
                                                "text": "Or what about hetero- and homoflexibility (the primarily heterosexual or homosexual orientation with occasional forays into things not typical of those sexualities)?"
                                            },
